r_button_gradient":"","color_overlay":"#171717","overlay_opacity":0,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"divider":false,"full_width":true,"rounded":false}},"image_with_text_brndHw":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_TjfqLJ":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"A Note from Our Founder","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","highlighted_reveal":false}},"text_MgCjEV":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>For years, I struggled with restless nights. Menopause brought hot flashes and disrupted sleep. My teenage daughter's sensitive skin made finding the right bedding another challenge. My husband and I could never seem to agree on the right sleeping temperature. <\/p><p>As a professor, I spent my career studying problems and turning observations into solutions. Looking at my own family's sleep struggles, I realized these were different expressions of the same problem: sleep interrupted, night after night. <\/p><p>That insight became the foundation of Breescape®. I set out to create bedding that goes beyond simply feeling soft — engineering every piece with science-backed materials to manage temperature and moisture through the night, combined with the care and precision I've always brought to my work. For anyone who has woken up too warm, too uncomfortable, or simply disturbed, I hope Breescape helps you experience what better sleep can feel like.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"half_text","highlighted_scribble":"sketch-underline"}},"text_WPXpNP":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><em><strong>— Helen Wu, Founder of Breescape<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","text_font":"heading","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"liquid_6xE7DY":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"liquid":"<a class=\"button discover-btn button--primary with-content flex items-center cursor-pointer py-4\" role=\"link\"\n    aria-controls=\"Hotspot-ergonomics\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"More on Ergonomics\"\n    id=\"shopify-block-ergonomics\">\n    <span class=\"xo__btn-icon discover-btn__icon\">\n        {%- render 'icon', icon: 'arrow-right', size: 'sm', class: '' -%}\n    <\/span>\n    <span class=\"btn-plus btn-text discover-btn__text\" style=\"color:rgb(var(--color-foreground))!important;\">Read More<\/span>\n\n<\/a>\n\n\n<x-modal id=\"Hotspot-ergonomics\" class=\"x-modal drawer z-30 fixed bottom-0 left-0 h-full w-full pointer-events-none\"\n    role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"More on Ergonomics\" hidden>\n    <overlay-element\n        class=\"overlay fixed-modal invisible opacity-0 fixed bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-screen pointer-events-none\"\n        aria-controls=\"Hotspot-ergonomics\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><\/overlay-element>\n\n    <div class=\"drawer__inner z-10 absolute top-0 flex flex-col w-full h-full overflow-hidden\">\n        <gesture-element class=\"drawer__header flex justify-between opacity-0 invisible relative items-center\">\n            <span class=\"drawer__title heading text-lg-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight\">A Note From Our Founder<\/span>\n            <button\n                class=\"button button--secondary button--close drawer__close hidden sm:flex items-center justify-center\"\n                type=\"button\" is=\"hover-button\" aria-controls=\"Hotspot-ergonomics\" aria-expanded=\"false\"\n                aria-label=\"Close\">\n                <span class=\"btn-fill\" data-fill><\/span>\n                <span class=\"btn-text\">\n                    {% render 'icon', icon: 'close', size: 'sm' %}\n                <\/span>\n            <\/button>\n        <\/gesture-element>\n\n        <div class=\"drawer__content opacity-0 invisible flex flex-col h-full grow shrink\">\n            <div class=\"drawer__scrollable relative flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-7 grow shrink\" style=\"padding: 0 !important;\">\n                <div class=\"rte text-base md:text-lg\">\n                    <div class=\"container mx-auto py-10\">\n\n\n\n                        <div class=\"xo__founder__modal__story\">\n                            <picture class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__bg\">\n                                <source media=\"(max-width: 767px)\"\n                                    srcset=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0640\/6779\/7070\/files\/aboutpage_founder_modal_background_image_md_202602_v1.webp?v=1770868277\"\n                                    type=\"image\/webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" \/>\n                                <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0640\/6779\/7070\/files\/aboutpage_founder_modal_background_image_lg_202602_v1.webp?v=1770868277\"\n                                    srcset=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0640\/6779\/7070\/files\/aboutpage_founder_modal_background_image_lg_202602_v1.webp?v=1770868277\"\n                                    sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"How Breescape Came to Be background\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"\n                                    style=\"margin-block:0;\" \/>\n                            <\/picture>\n\n                            <div class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__inner relative flex flex-col\">\n                                <header class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__hero\">\n                                    <h2 class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__title text-white\">How Breescape Came to Be<\/h2>\n                                    <p class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__subtitle text-white text-sm\">\n                                        Breescape began with a very common feeling: some nights, no matter how long you\n                                        lay in bed, you still wake up exhausted, both in body and mind.\n                                    <\/p>\n                                <\/header>\n\n                                <div class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__card\">\n                                    <div class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__avatar\">\n                                        <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0640\/6779\/7070\/files\/aboutpage_founder_modal_avater_image_202602_v1.webp?v=1770868328\"\n                                            alt=\"Founder portrait\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"margin-block:0;\" \/>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__content\">\n                                        <div class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__heading\">\n                                            <div class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__name text-lg font-bold\">Helen Wu<\/div>\n                                            <div class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__role text-lg\">Founder of Breescape<\/div>\n                                        <\/div>\n\n                                        <div class=\"xo__founder__modal__story__body text-base\">\n                                            <p>\nBefore I was a founder, I was a professor—trained to ask why before looking for how. That's the career I left behind to start Bedsure®, where I spent years thinking about comfort not just as softness, but as the feeling of slowing down and being cared for.\n                                            <\/p>\n                                            <p>\nBut then menopause soaked my sheets night after night. My teenage daughter's sensitive skin made restful sleep hard to come by. My husband and I could never agree on the thermostat. I realized comfort alone wasn't enough.\n                                            <\/p>\n                                            <p>\nSo I returned to what I knew best: asking questions, testing ideas, and following the evidence. I came to believe that truly restorative sleep doesn't happen by chance—it requires thoughtful design, rigorous testing, and a deeper understanding of how our bodies respond to heat, moisture, and the sleep environment.\n                                            <\/p>\n                                            <p>Breescape® grew from that realization.<\/p>\n                                            <p>\nDrawing on that research-driven approach and over 46 years of textile experience behind us at Bedsure®, we set out to combine long-standing craft with modern sleep science — working closely with sleep researchers, materials engineers, and product designers. Through continuous testing and iterations, every Breescape® piece is engineered with science-backed materials to manage temperature and moisture through the night, building toward a full-night sleep solution.\n                                            <\/p>\n                                            <p>\nEvery detail is guided by one simple question: how can we sleep with fewer disruptions, so the body can rest naturally?\n                                            <\/p>\n                                            <p>Our hope is that every Breescape® product is built to help you sleep through.<\/p>\n                                        <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                    <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/x-modal>\n\n<style>\n    .btn-plus+.plus {\n        width: 1.75em;\n        height: 1.75em;\n        border-radius: 50em;\n        margin-left: 0.5em;\n    }\n\n\n    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .discover-btn {\n            background: linear-gradient(270deg, #67D2E0 0%, #67D2E040 100%) !important;\n    }\n\n\n\n    .xo__founde